  "action": "Fixed two bugs. Bug 1 (broken search flow): added useEffect auto-submit in ask/content.tsx — when initialQuery is present from URL, auto-runs runSearch on mount via useRef guard. Extracted runSearch as useCallback with cache-first strategy. Landing page now pre-fetches API and caches before navigating, so ask page reads from sessionStorage instantly. Changed submittedQuery init from initialQuery to empty string for correct empty-state display. Bug 2 (search bar frame spill): replaced transition-all with transition-colors transition-shadow on both search bar containers, added overflow-hidden, added appearance-none + autoComplete=off to inputs, added -webkit-autofill CSS reset in globals.css to prevent browser autofill background frames. Build passes clean — 7 routes, exit 0. Zero design changes."
